Tree Atlas is a new project by David Kaminski, informed by the earlier
dvkam/baumkataster-wien application. No Git history was imported.

DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THE CODE'S MIT LICENCE.

Vienna: Datenquelle: Stadt Wien — data.wien.gv.at. CC BY 4.0.
Geneva: Données SITG / Ville de Genève. SITG A open-access conditions.
Porto: Município do Porto. CC0.
The extracts are geographically filtered and normalized. Source fields are
reduced and measurement meanings retained. Retrieval dates, exact source
requests and processing details are in public/data/provenance.json.

Copernicus: European Union's Copernicus Land Monitoring Service information,
Street Tree Layer 2021. https://doi.org/10.2909/ed0018c3-5ad0-4721-b5e4-0042aeaf9d00
